      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUSSIE STRIKE (4) turned in a plain run last time when eighth at Bendigo over 425m behind Elma's Girl (25.30) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. The form out of his last race has been franked. Rates on top in this line up. STARSHIP ATLAS (1) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 5th (22.39) at this track. Has placed several times at this track. Better than last start and can bounce back. ASTON SCANNER (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Aston Fumiko (22.66) in a Grade 5. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Can measure up. COMPARE JOE (3) cannot be ruled out.",
